<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 4.4</h2>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fix ui issue.</li>
<li>Resolve session workspace context.</li>
<li>Ship release-managed AI workflow defaults.</li>
<li>Preview linked worktree issues.</li>
<li>Open forked chats automatically.</li>
<li>Create Linear issues from notes.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Declare macOS app bundle metadata.</li>
<li>Preserve newer terminal writer reservations.</li>
<li>Preserve live server during terminal handoff.</li>
<li>Address AI configuration review findings.</li>
<li>Enforce release-managed AI configuration contracts.</li>
<li>Keep toolbar actions grouped.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.4">https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.4</a></p>
